-   $ holst o add sticker "Roadmap" "Ask design" -c yellow4
== shape
+   holst object add shape <board> [<text>] [flags]
+       --shape shape          The kind of shape, e.g. ellipse, flowchart-decision or bpmn-gateway; square by default
+   $ holst o add shape "Roadmap" "Launch" --shape diamond
-   holst object add sticker <board> [<text>] [flags]
